    "html": "<p>The motion of a particle in a two-dimensional plane is analyzed. At a specific instant, the perpendicular components of its velocity are measured and recorded in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Velocity component</th><th>Magnitude / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mathrm{m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Horizontal component (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_x\"></span>)</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Vertical component (<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_y\"></span>)</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"15\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the resultant velocity of the particle at this instant?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"17 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"23 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"120 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
